<body class="bg-background text-on-background font-body-md antialiased flex flex-col min-h-screen">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main class="flex-grow pt-[92px] pb-16">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="py-section-padding px-margin-x max-w-container-max mx-auto text-center flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-secondary-container/20 border border-secondary-container/40 rounded-full text-secondary font-label-md text-sm font-medium mb-6">
        <i class="ri-refund-line"></i>
        <span>Money-Back Guarantee</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg font-display-lg-mobile md:font-display-lg text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">
        Refund Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body-lg font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        shadiAmour offers a 100% money-back guarantee within 15 days of your paid plan.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Policy -->
    <section class="px-margin-x max-w-container-max mx-auto pb-section-padding">
      <div class="bg-surface-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(0,35,102,0.05)] p-6 md:p-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="policy-body">
          <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-6"><em>Last updated: 10 August 2026</em></p>
          <p>We want you to feel confident in choosing shadiAmour. That's why we offer the following guarantee on our paid plans (Premium, Premium Plus, Executive):</p>

          <h2>15-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h2>
          <p>If you are not satisfied with your paid plan within the first 15 days of purchase, you are entitled to a full refund, no questions asked.</p>

          <h2>Service-Based Refunds</h2>
          <p>Beyond the initial 15-day window, refunds are available if shadiAmour fails to deliver the specific committed services attached to your plan — for example:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Premium Plus/Executive members who do not receive their agreed weekly curated matches</li>
            <li>Executive members whose "fully managed communication" service is not delivered as described</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To request this type of refund, contact us with details of the service that was not delivered, and we will review your case within 30 business days.</p>

          <h2>How to Request a Refund</h2>
          <p>Email <a href="mailto:contact@shadiamour.com">contact@shadiamour.com</a> with:</p>
          <ol>
            <li>The email address associated with your account</li>
            <li>Your plan name and purchase date</li>
            <li>The reason for your refund request</li>
          </ol>
          <p>Approved refunds are processed to your original payment method within 30 business days.</p>

          <h2>What Isn't Covered</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Refunds are not provided simply because you found a match or stopped actively using the Platform after the 15-day window (unless a specific service failure applies, as above).</li>
            <li>The free Standard plan has no associated fees and therefore no refund applies.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Questions</h2>
          <p>Contact <a href="mailto:contact@shadiamour.com">contact@shadiamour.com</a> for anything refund-related.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
